# Files excluded from a distributable theme .zip.
# Build-time and development artefacts only — never user-facing theme code.
# `colophon new` copies this into every generated theme so the line ships clean.
#
# Colophon core dropped the --wporg/--github build split and the
# self-updater it existed for (themes.trac #276778); current
# package-theme.sh does one rsync --exclude-from=.distignore build and
# hard-fails if inc/github-updater.php reaches the dist directory. Both
# CLI-only files are excluded below; functions.php guards each require
# with file_exists() so excluding them here is safe under WP-CLI too.
/inc/github-updater.php
/inc/cli.php
/.distignore
/.git
/.github
/.gitignore
/node_modules
/vendor
/colophon
/colophon.json
/colophon.manifest.json
/ARCHITECTURE.md
/DESIGN-UPLIFT.md
/PILLARS.md
/README.md
/GUIDE.md
/THEME-CHECK.md
/tools
/composer.json
/composer.lock
/phpcs.xml.dist
/phpstan.neon
/package.json
/package-lock.json
*.zip

